OL,3,AJohn Swinney insists medical chief was
OL,4,Anot told to go amid growing NHS
OL,5,AGrampian scandal
OL,6,
OL,7,FScotland's Chief Medical Officer Gregor
OL,8,FSmith resigns from his post on health
OL,9,Fgrounds. It comes in the wake of
OL,10,Fserious problems with healthcare in the
OL,11,Fnorth east of Scotland
OL,13,FFirst Minister John Swinney insists
OL,14,FSmith was not told to go because of the
OL,15,Fbrewing scandal over the running of NHS
OL,16,FGrampian
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
