OL,3,AJohn Swinney insists medical chief was
OL,4,Anot told to go amid growing NHS
OL,5,AGrampian scandal
OL,6,
OL,7,FA health watchdog report has criticised
OL,8,Fthe board's leadership failures and a
OL,9,Fwhistleblower surgeon leaked
OL,10,Funpublished internal findings that
OL,11,Fdeaths of liver and pancreatic surgery
OL,12,Fpatients could have been avoided
OL,14,FScotland's Health Secretary Angela
OL,15,FConstance has appointed a team to help
OL,16,FNHS Grampian make improvements and
OL,17,Fordered an independent review into
OL,18,Fliver and pancreatic operations in the
OL,19,Fhealth board area
